---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="We Run on Our Own AI System | The One Group"
  description="The One Group doesn't just sell AI automation — we run on it. See the live proof: leads researched, emails drafted, and CRM records created automatically."
>

  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 via-white to-brand-50/30 dark:from-gray-950 dark:via-gray-950 dark:to-brand-950/20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center">
      <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-widest">System Proof</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-display font-bold mt-4 mb-4">
        We Don't Just Sell AI Automation.<br class="hidden sm:block" /> We Run on It.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        The One Group operates its own business on the exact AI system we build for clients.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-8">

      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-3xl">
        Most AI agencies <em>talk</em> about automation. We <strong>live</strong> it. Every lead below was researched, every email was drafted, and every CRM record was created by our own AI agents — with zero manual data entry.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 rounded-r-xl p-6">
        <p class="text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 font-medium">
          <strong>This is not a demo.</strong> These are real numbers from our live operating system, generated automatically as we run our own pipeline.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Live stats -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">80+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Leads Researched</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">13</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Emails Drafted</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">94</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">CRM Records Created</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">0</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Hours of Manual Data Entry</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- How it works -->
      <div class="pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-bold mb-6">How It Works</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 max-w-3xl">
          Our pipeline runs every morning, automatically. Three AI agents work together while we sleep:
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-xl p-6">
            <p class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-300">
              <strong>🔍 Arlo — Research Agent</strong><br />
              Searches the web for real South Florida SMBs, scores them, and enriches contact info. Runs daily at 8:30 AM.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-xl p-6">
            <p class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-300">
              <strong>✉️ Iris — Outreach Agent</strong><br />
              Drafts personalized emails into Gmail (never sends without review) and pushes every lead to HubSpot. Runs daily at 8:45 AM.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-xl p-6">
            <p class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-300">
              <strong>📊 System Proof — Reporting</strong><br />
              Generates this report automatically every day, so we always know exactly what the system did.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Why it matters -->
      <div class="pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-bold mb-6">Why This Matters to You</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-3xl">
          When we say we can automate your lead generation, outreach, and CRM — we're not guessing. We're running the same system on ourselves, every single day. If it didn't work, we'd be the first to know.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-6">
          <div class="bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-900/20 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900/40 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <p class="text-red-800 dark:text-red-300">
              <strong>❌ Typical Agency</strong><br />
              Pitches automation they've never used. No proof. No receipts.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-900/40 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <p class="text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300">
              <strong>✅ The One Group</strong><br />
              Runs on the system we sell. Live numbers. Real proof.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="text-center pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-bold mb-4">Want This System Running Your Business?</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8">
          Let's build your own AI operating system — lead gen, outreach, and CRM, fully automated.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-accent-500 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
            Book a Free Audit
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="/services" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 border border-brand-200 dark:border-brand-800 hover:bg-brand-50 dark:hover:bg-brand-900/30 transition-colors">
            See How It Works
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
